Stream native output with responsive lifetime owners

Move network sends and incremental chardata/MFA formatting into registered,
owned workers. Preserve exact physical credits, durable chunk ACKs, deferred
publication and honest bounded close/cancellation across owner failures.

Add native encoding, startup, capacity and positively blocked teardown controls.

